     &lt;br /&gt;
     &ldquo;As an environmental science teacher, I can think of few programs that have been as valuable and impactful on so many levels as the snorkeling program. The evolution of their understanding of the connections between the life below the surface, the surrounding forest and themselves in the city of Albany is exactly what environmental science is about.&rdquo; â" Gareth Engler, West Albany HS teacher&lt;br /&gt;
