&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The operator of the vehicle (Palmer) was transported to an area hospital with reported minor injuries.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

