&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The highway was not impacted during the on-scene investigation. The cause of the crash is under investigation.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;OSP was assisted by the Josephine County Sheriff's Office, Rural Metro Fire Department, and ODOT.&lt;/p&gt;

