&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:16px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;More information about ESGR and employer support resources is available at www.esgr.mil. A video interview with Owens is available at:&amp;nbsp;https://www.dvidshub.net/video/976045/oregon-esgr-honors-cunningham-welcomes-&lt;br /&gt;
owens-new-state-chair&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

